 description:'Create a Gujarati marriage biodata with practical guidance for family, education, career, lineage and privacy fields. No login required.', template:'midnight-gold',
 intro:'A useful Gujarati marriage biodata should make family background easy to understand without turning every tradition into a mandatory field. Include the details your family actually uses when discussing a match, and leave sensitive information out of a copy that will circulate widely.',
